{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1536","id":4038900757,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87wvLwV","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1536","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1536.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1536.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1536","number":1536,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] freeze 9709 PDF-first rebuild governance plans","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 背景\n\n9709 既有数据治理曾把 artifact/runtime completeness、schema 通过和 issue close 误当成 source truth 与产品发布就绪。E1 外部 VLM pilot 虽证明调用链可运行，但在冻结 Gold 下仅 4/60 进入 local accepted delta，暴露了旧上游 QP、MS、FigureAsset、KG 等对象缺乏 PDF-first source authority、独立 Gold、完整 page-chain 和逐对象 acceptance evidence 的根本问题。\n\n这会直接影响学生体验：缺题干、漏小问、错 marks、缺必要图像、MS 错链或旧版本混读，都可能沿 KG/RAG/runtime 被放大。继续在旧派生数据上补丁式治理，无法证明 9709 V1 的用户对象完整性。\n\n## 本 PR 做什么\n\n本 PR 冻结三份中文治理文档及报告索引：\n\n- 9709 全量数据治理失败现状报告；\n- PDF-first 生产级数据重建 Master Plan；\n- PDF-first AO 重型 Campaign 执行计划。\n\n文档最终合同包括：\n\n- official PDF / SourceAuthoritySet 为事实源，旧文本、KG 和历史 artifacts 仅作为 candidate；\n- accepted 按字段与 capability evidence 聚合，并以 ExpectedQuestionSet / ExpectedSubpartSet exact equality 防止自洽式漏题；\n- QP、visual、MS、KG、RAG、rights/display 状态分离；\n- Campaign A 使用 ParentCreationGate 与 PaidExecutionGate 两阶段准入；\n- 120-row sealed holdout 使用 repo 外 custody、ACL、prediction freeze 与 qualification-key invalidation；\n- Campaign A 采用一个 parent、8 个 children 和隔离的 truth verification / promotion / readback / exact-SHA contexts；\n- parent close 由 machine-executable outcome validator 强制，而不是 child/PR throughput；\n- Campaign B 目标为至少 1500 个去重 technical practice-complete questions，并显式约束 component、complete paper、MS、visual、hard case 与产品 readback；\n- local technical、display eligible、production active 与 student visible 不可越级推导。\n\n## 边界\n\n这是文档冻结 PR，不实现 ParentCreationGate，不创建 Campaign A issues，不调用 provider/VLM，不写入远端 Supabase、Storage、Vector/RAG，也不做 production/public-display 变更。\n\n合并后下一阶段是实现 ParentCreationGate 的 JSON/schema/ACL/validator/receipt/required checks；在 gate 真正通过前，Campaign A parent creation 仍为 NO-GO。\n\n## 验证\n\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — passed，3 个新增报告均已登记，0 violations；\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` — passed；\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — safe_to_edit，workspace clean；唯一 warning 为分支在推送前 ahead of upstream；\n- 冻结文档与已复审基线提交 `6ae5f5eb2` 的对应字节一致。\n","created_at":"2026-07-12T12:18:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T13:03:48Z","closed_at":"2026-07-12T13:03:48Z","merged_at":"2026-07-12T13:03:48Z","merge_commit_sha":"5070f7a591f7cc6b4beebc14e479b29289e40ae4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1536/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1536/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","co